    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρθητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not sacked, unravaged,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πριάμοιο . . ἀ. πόλις ἔπλεν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαγοὺς ἀπορθήτων ἀγυιᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					8.52
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				99
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσον ἀ. λείπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
					16.3
				</span></i>
			; of Attica, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				826
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				348
			</span></i>; of Laconia, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.73
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				33.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἐφύσων οἱ Λάκωνες ὡς ἀπόρθητοί
					ποτε;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					117
				</span></i>
			.</div>
